  "statement": "Consider a permutation P = (p_1, p_2, ..., p_n) of numbers \\{1, 2, ... , n\\}. Let us construct a graph G(P) with n vertices as follows: if i, j \\in \\{1, ..., n\\} and i < j, then an undirected edge (i, j) is present in G(P) if and only if p_i < p_j.",
